<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>位置融合 on 如是有为</title><link>https://sensor.fans/tags/%E4%BD%8D%E7%BD%AE%E8%9E%8D%E5%90%88/</link><description>Recent content in 位置融合 on 如是有为</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 21:54:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://sensor.fans/tags/%E4%BD%8D%E7%BD%AE%E8%9E%8D%E5%90%88/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>编码器开发专题（五）位置融合-下卷</title><link>https://sensor.fans/posts/kajfsqri8_ixjltddm4ynq/</link><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 21:54:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://sensor.fans/posts/kajfsqri8_ixjltddm4ynq/</guid><description>&lt;p>前情提要：上中卷分别介绍了QEP计数和角度细分相关知识点，以及在实际应用过程中为何有跳点问题、如何通过软硬件手段去处理等内容。本篇给大家着重介绍一下噪声问题，想必小伙伴在开发中会时常碰到。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>编码器开发专题（四）位置融合-中卷</title><link>https://sensor.fans/posts/ghuh42nc1myiwvbkmlpafw/</link><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 09:54:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://sensor.fans/posts/ghuh42nc1myiwvbkmlpafw/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://sensor.fans/images/wx/ce0ecada464c4c55b10d98018148692b.png" alt="ce0ecada464c4c55b10d98018148692b.png" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
&lt;/p>
&lt;p>前情提要：上卷中介绍了位置融合跳点的原因、现象、硬件同步处理，各位小伙伴如果需要详细的介绍可在专题系列位置融合-上卷查阅；本卷内容将给大家呈现软件层面的补偿算法。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>编码器开发专题（三）位置融合-上卷</title><link>https://sensor.fans/posts/tteyq-utocz4oerkwzxwrg/</link><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 11:10:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://sensor.fans/posts/tteyq-utocz4oerkwzxwrg/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://sensor.fans/images/wx/407e18bf083bce1a6790ba789359e6fe.jpg" alt="407e18bf083bce1a6790ba789359e6fe.jpg" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
&lt;/p>
&lt;p>前言:本章主要介绍QEP计数+细分位置的融合，Z信号问控处理，数字滤波，边界位置跳点处理。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>应用场景:增量式光栅尺，光电编码器等。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>在之前的文章中已经介绍了QEP计数和周期内细分，在实际的应用中往往这两者需要配合计算位置。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>